<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's oil firm Astra nine-mth net $34.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's oil firm Astra nine-mth net $34.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30. Net $34.6 million vs n/a. NOTE: the company did not provide comparisons, revenues or earnings per share, nor third quarter results. At September 30 net worth stood at $588.8 million. The company reported retained earnings of $140.4 million. Full company name is ASTRA CAPSA. It is 37.7 pct owned by Spain's Repsol SA. -- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
